{"id":"input-1cd9327ccf5e","steamAppId":"779330","name":"Ninja Tycoon","imageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/779330/portrait.png","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/779330/","genres":["Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"platforms":["windows","mac","linux"],"controllerSupport":"unknown","playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"localCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"onlineCoop":false,"maximumPlayers":null},"storage":{"windowsMinimumGB":1.0,"windowsMinimumDisplay":"1 GB"},"verificationStatus":"identified","supportsVietnamese":false,"vietnameseSupportStatus":"not_listed","steamTags":["Simulation","Strategy","Indie","Management","Economy","Ninja","Medieval","Casual"],"sourceProfile":{"shortDescription":"Recruit Ninjas, Hire Workers, build your base, train your Ninjas and send them on Missions!","developers":["Endless Loop Studios"]},"content":{"status":"success","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T09:45:23.342680+00:00","identityStatus":"verified","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","shortDescription":"Recruit Ninjas, Hire Workers, build your base, train your Ninjas and send them on Missions!","detailedDescription":"In Ninja Tycoon you manage a Ninja Village with the goal to grow your base and your army so you can Assassinate the local Clan Leaders and take over the world!\n\nBuild up your village by hiring Workers to gather goods and craft equipment.\nRecruit Ninjas and send them on increasingly difficult and profitable missions\nTrain them in Stealth, Attack, Support and Agility\nDefend your base from attacking raiders\nComplete missions and take over the world!"},"vi":{"status":"translated","shortDescription":"Hãy tuyển chọn Ninjas, công nhân Hire, xây dựng căn cứ của bạn, huấn luyện những Ninja của bạn và gửi chúng đến Trung tâm!","detailedDescription":"Ở Ninja Tycoon, anh quản lý một ngôi làng Ninja với mục tiêu phát triển căn cứ của anh và quân đội của anh để anh có thể ám sát những thủ lĩnh c